{"abstract":"The National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration published a notice in the Federal Register concerning a public meeting of the Advisory Committee on Excellence in Space. The notice is in the Federal Register of January 29, 2025, in FR Doc. 2025-01885, on page 8387. The meeting scheduled for Wednesday, March 5, 2025, from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. (ET) is cancelled.","action":"Notice of Meeting; Cancellation.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2025/03/05/2025-03566.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"90 FR 11303","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":null,"disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":[],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2025-03566","effective_on":null,"end_page":11303,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2025/03/05/2025-03566.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/03/05/2025-03566/advisory-committee-on-excellence-in-space-aces-notice-of-cancellation","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2025-03566?publication_date=2025-03-05","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2025-03-05/2025-03566/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"page_length":1,"page_views":{"count":60,"last_updated":"2026-08-03 06:15:04 -0400"},"pdf_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-03-05/pdf/2025-03566.pdf","presidential_document_number":null,"proclamation_number":null,"public_inspection_pdf_url":"https://public-inspection.federalregister.gov/2025-03566.pdf?1741095916","publication_date":"2025-03-05","raw_text_url":"ht